    "updated_at": "2019-02-27T01:35:41Z",
    "body": "Native lazy loading images [1] would make the need here obsolete, but in its absence, having some way to say \"wait! before you go print do these things!\" is missing.\r\n\r\n[1]  (https://calibreapp.com/blog/native-lazy-load/)\r\n",
